      "voice_name": "Raspy - Convincing and Weary Narrator",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The farm compound keeps its gate shut and its dogs loose. A lot of traffic for a farm that grows nothing.",
      "chars": 105,
